      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `ciArtifacts` resource represents an artifact that Xcode Cloud creates when it performs a workflow’s action. Use it to access the artifact’s:",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Use the provided information to create statistics for the artifacts Xcode Cloud creates or archive Xcode Cloud build artifacts on your own server.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Note**\n>\n>  This resource supports JSON web tokens with a lifetime of up to six months. For more information, see `generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime"
          ]
        }
